":"fmx","d":"2019-07-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Eduardo Padilla Silva","x":"In terms of the composition of the same-store sales, during the quarter, we saw meaningful price increases in some of our larger destination categories such as soft drinks, cigarettes, and coffee which helped drive the average figure up.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/26/fomento-economico-mexicano-sab-de-cv-fmx-q2-2019-e.aspx"},{"c":"FMX 2019 Q2","e":"fmx","d":"2019-07-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Juan Fonseca","x":"I think, if we just look at the narrow kind of little window of OXXO, the best explainer of what happened during the quarter is -- has to do with these big price increases being taken on the part of these large categories.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/26/fomento-economico-mexicano-sab-de-cv-fmx-q2-2019-e.aspx"},{"c":"FMX 2019 Q3","e":"fmx","d":"2019-10-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Eduardo Padilla Silva","x":"In terms of the composition of same-store sales, during the quarter, we continued to see meaningful price increases in some of our destination categories.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/28/fomento-economico-mexicano-sab-de-cv-fmx-q3-2019-e.aspx"},{"c":"FMX 2019 Q3","e":"fmx","d":"2019-10-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Juan Fonseca","x":"…at OXXO Mexico, certainly, we've made these comments about destination categories having taken price increases and I think the consumer in some cases -- in the case of the beverages, for example, moving a little bit more to bigger kind of from single serve to multi-serve, we have seen these…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/28/fomento-economico-mexicano-sab-de-cv-fmx-q3-2019-e.aspx"},{"c":"FMX 2019 Q4","e":"fmx","d":"2020-02-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Eduardo Padilla Silva","x":"In terms of the composition of same-store sales during the quarter we continued to see meaningful price increases in some of our destination categories.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/27/fomento-economico-mexicano-sab-de-cv-fmx-q4-2019-e.aspx"},{"c":"FMX 2019 Q4","e":"fmx","d":"2020-02-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Eduardo Padilla Silva","x":"…in our legacy territories were more than offset by lower operating leverage in Chile; number two the consolidation of Corporacion GPF which has a relatively higher operating expense structure; and number three expenses related to the restructuring programs at our operations in Chile and Ecuador.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/27/fomento-economico-mexicano-sab-de-cv-fmx-q4-2019-e.aspx"},{"c":"FMX 2020 Q4","e":"fmx","d":"2021-03-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Rodrigo Alcantara","x":"The admin expenses on other businesses, part has to do with just the addition of WAXIE and North America, but there were also a couple of one-time charges taken at Solistica with regards to restructuring as we adapted to the pandemic, so basically headcount restructuring from the pandemic.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/03/01/fomento-economico-mexicano-sab-de-cv-fmx-q4-2020-e/"},{"c":"FMX 2021 Q2","e":"fmx","d":"2021-07-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Eugenio Garza Y. Garza","x":"Correct, greater pricing power and then also, I think, a shift in terms of our commercial strategy with regards to working with suppliers to put out the -- concentrating the purchasing power in less SKUs, the ones that move the greatest where we can get better margins.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/29/fomento-economico-mexicano-sab-de-cv-fmx-q2-2021-e/"},{"c":"FMX 2021 Q2","e":"fmx","d":"2021-07-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Eugenio Garza Y. Garza","x":"And then also that we frankly took advantage of this pandemic to really be more efficient on the cost side and that those cost savings will continue into the future and provide for a more profitable OXXO once traffic and ticket levels normalize.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/29/fomento-economico-mexicano-sab-de-cv-fmx-q2-2021-e/"},{"c":"FMX 2026 Q2","e":"fmx","d":"2026-10-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Juan Fonseca","x":"…income grew 7.2%, reflecting OXXO Mexico's strong performance, contributions from our international operations, and the benefits of our restructuring initiatives, partially offset by currency headwinds, the softer performance of health in Europe, and the consolidation of losses at OXXO Brasil.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/28/femsa-fmx-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[35,1,8281,0,0,0,6590,1207],[38,1,7995,0,0,0,5869,1686],[39,1,7113,0,0,0,5560,1139],[40,1,6893,0,0,0,5751,804],[41,1,8279,0,0,0,6728,1072],[42,1,10448,0,0,0,8064,1802],[43,1,8023,0,0,0,6358,1090],[44,1,10204,0,0,0,4399,5330],[45,1,6946,0,0,0,5436,1114],[46,1,7945,0,0,0,6053,1345],[47,1,6848,0,0,0,5542,860],[67,1,12074,0,0,0,5606,4891]],"cinema":[[35,1,8281,0,0,0,6590,1207],[38,1,7995,0,0,0,5869,1686],[39,1,7113,0,0,0,5560,1139],[40,1,6893,0,0,0,5751,804],[41,1,8279,0,0,0,6728,1072],[42,1,10448,0,0,0,8064,1802],[43,1,8023,0,0,0,6358,1090],[44,1,10204,0,0,0,4399,5330],[45,1,6946,0,0,0,5436,1114],[46,1,7945,0,0,0,6053,1345],[47,1,6848,0,0,0,5542,860],[67,1,12074,0,0,0,5606,4891]],"imax":[[35,1,8281,0,0,0,6590,1207],[38,1,7995,0,0,0,5869,1686],[39,1,7113,0,0,0,5560,1139],[40,1,6893,0,0,0,5751,804],[41,1,8279,0,0,0,6728,1072],[42,1,10448,0,0,0,8064,1802],[43,1,8023,0,0,0,6358,1090],[44,1,10204,0,0,0,4399,5330],[45,1,6946,0,0,0,5436,1114],[46,1,7945,0,0,0,6053,1345],[47,1,6848,0,0,0,5542,860],[67,1,12074,0,0,0,5606,4891]],"streaming":[[35,1,8281,0,0,0,6590,1207],[38,1,7995,0,0,0,5869,1686],[39,1,7113,0,0,0,5560,1139],[40,1,6893,0,0,0,5751,804],[41,1,8279,0,0,0,6728,1072],[42,1,10448,0,0,0,8064,